  "solution": "**Given**\n\n3.25 × 3.25 × 3.25 + 0.75 × 0.75 × 0.75 + 29.25\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n⇒ 3.25 × 3.25 × 3.25 = 34.328125\n\n⇒ 0.75 × 0.75 × 0.75 = 0.421875\n\n⇒ Adding results and 29.25, we get 34.328125 + 0.421875 + 29.25 = 64\n\n**Therefore, the value of 3.25 × 3.25 × 3.25 + 0.75 × 0.75 × 0.75 + 29.25 is 64.**",
